Z||000019||Fierochic88||06-10-2001||08:47 PM||||Hey Guyz - just make sure it's legal in your state.  My friend put blue lenses in his and took the red vinyl out, he may have even put blue vinyl in.  In PA the lights can only be red.  He got a bad ticket.  Supposedly that is the standard way of identifying the rear of a vehicle.  Whatever  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Jennifer<BR>Silver 88 GT<BR>Silver 86 Cp<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT||||reg||1
